[stderr] # 06 — Foundation and domain authoring contracts
[stderr] 
[stderr] **Inputs:** [delivery map](05-delivery-map.md), [technical contract](../specification/03-technical-contract.md), [feature model](../specification/02-feature-model.md), and [experience contract](../specification/04-experience-contract.md).
