[stderr] 
[stderr] **Inputs:** [delivery map](05-delivery-map.md), [foundation and domain contracts](06-foundation-domain-contracts.md), [feature model](../specification/02-feature-model.md), and [experience contract](../specification/04-experience-contract.md).
