[stderr] 1. Engine/framework, package manager, CI runtime, storage API/quota, host/CDN,
[stderr]    service-worker rollout, browser/device/assistive-technology matrix,
[stderr]    performance budgets, locales, retention policy, legal/age/regional policy,
[stderr]    and support ownership require approval.
[stderr] 2. Production hosting, deployment, rollback execution, external scans, paid
[stderr]    test services, real-device labs, store submission, legal review, and any
[stderr]    account action require separately granted authority and real evidence.
[stderr] 3. Account identity, cloud sync, multiplayer/player safety, live-service
[stderr]    operations, analytics, commerce, and entitlements remain excluded. They
[stderr]    need new product, privacy, security, operational, cost, and failure-mode
[stderr]    contracts before implementation or release claims.
