07-feature-experience-contracts.md:30:### FEX-02 \u2014 Town-to-dungeon exploration journey\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/07-feature-experience-contracts.md:32:- **Target / ownership:** Shared campaign/exploration; `src/core/{exploration,campaign}` and `src/app/game`; browser evidence `supervisor/browser/tests/changes/fex-02-exploration.spec.*`.\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/07-feature-experience-contracts.md:37:- **Acceptance evidence:** Scripted core route reaches ending; negative fixtures reject unresolved exits; Playwright verifies town-to-dungeon progression, locked-exit explanation, and narrow/wide interaction controls.\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/07-feature-experience-contracts.md:39:### FEX-03 \u2014 Dialogue, quest, and ending journey\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/07-feature-experience-contracts.md:41:- **Target / ownership:** Shared narrative state and panels; `src/core/{dialogue,quest,campaign}` and `src/app/{dialogue,panels}`; browser evidence `supervisor/browser/tests/changes/fex-03-quest-ending.spec.*`.\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/07-feature-experience-contracts.md:46:- **Acceptance evidence:** Predicate, repeated-interaction, one-time-reward, and ending-transition tests; Playwright verifies visible objective and ending path.\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/07-feature-experience-contracts.md:48:### FEX-04 \u2014 Turn-based combat and defeat recovery\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/07-feature-experience-contracts.md:50:- **Target / ownership:** Shared combat rules and presentation; `src/core/combat`, `src/app/combat`; browser evidence `supervisor/browser/tests/changes/fex-04-combat.spec.*`.\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/planning/07-feature-experience-contracts.md:55:- **Acceptance evidence:** Deterministic win/loss, legal-action, stale-action, reward-once, and defeat-checkpoint tests; Playwright completes the tutorial battle using keyboard only and verifies phone action layout.\nproj